[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12960.309, "timestamp": "03:36:00", "text": "可以建造。就像弧光一样，你知道的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12982.469, "timestamp": "03:36:22", "text": "我给大家铺好了床。你可以攀爬"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12985.91, "timestamp": "03:36:25", "text": "你的。哦，我们在一起吗？我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12991.269, "timestamp": "03:36:31", "text": "他们都手牵着手吗？不。哦，该死的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12997.91, "timestamp": "03:36:37", "text": "什么？你在做什么？哦，改变"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13001.269, "timestamp": "03:36:41", "text": "最后，哦，我不需要做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13004.71, "timestamp": "03:36:44", "text": "这。哦，我真是太笨了。在哪里？没关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13007.269, "timestamp": "03:36:47", "text": "再按一次右键即可。它会走"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13010.349, "timestamp": "03:36:50", "text": "这里。我做了一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13013.51, "timestamp": "03:36:53", "text": "宠物，伙计们。你想看看我的宠物吗？我得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13016.71, "timestamp": "03:36:56", "text": "删除了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13018.309, "timestamp": "03:36:58", "text": "是啊，没人想看我的宠物。我"}]